Phase 2 — Critical IDOR fixes (highest risk)
Fix these before polishing the rest.

2.1 Enrollment module (EnrollmentController)
index — add where('school_id', $schoolId); validate term_id / class_id belong to school
updateStatus — scope enrollment lookup
showCorrection / executeCorrection — scope enrollment lookup
bulkUpdateStatus — scope each enrollment by school
Validation: correct_class_id, correct_stream_id scoped to tenant
2.2 User management
AdminController — edit / update / destroy use User $admin with no school_id check → cross-tenant user edit/delete
AccountantController — same issue on edit / update / destroy
